ll (a loss, not a lie)  (relay) reset follow (cold): alicebobThe writer runs unmodified. Every follow checks what it serves in any case.Run a row's scene on a new World: flipEventdropLastEventforgesRefusallieLookuplieCancelforgeCancelforkedPost","Frames_×frame#79 (command 7)from → toalice → followopresumebytes410replyok#0alice→followcommandok 14B#1alice→followresumeok 216B#2alice→writerlogok 248B#3alice→followresumeok 344B#4alice→followresumeok 557B#5alice→writersubmitok 278B#6alice→followcommandok 575B#7alice→followresumeok 777B#8alice→writerlogok 248B#9alice→followresumeok 1188B#10alice→followresumeok 526B#11alice→followcommandok 115B#12alice→followresumeok 317B#13alice→writerlogok 248B#14alice→followresumeok 445B#15alice→followresumeok 784B#16alice→writersubmitok 404B#17alice→followcommandok 827B#18alice→followresumeok 1029B#19alice→writerlogok 248B#20alice→followresumeok 1566B#21alice→followresumeok 685B#22alice→followcommandok 85B#23alice→followresumeok 287B#24alice→writerlogok 248B#25alice→followresumeok 415B#26alice→followcommandok 159B#27alice→followresumeok 361B#28alice→writerlogok 248B#29alice→followresumeok 489B#30alice→followresumeok 827B#31alice→writersubmitok 403B#32alice→followcommandok 825B#33alice→followresumeok 1027B#34alice→writerlogok 248B#35alice→followresumeok 1563B#36alice→followresumeok 796B#37bob→followcommandok 178B#38bob→followresumeok 380B#39bob→writerlogok 248B#40bob→followresumeok 1608B#41bob→followresumeok 929B#42alice→followcommandok 110B#43alice→followresumeok 312B#44alice→writerlogok 248B#45alice→followresumeok 440B#46alice→followresumeok 774B#47alice→writersubmitok 399B#48alice→followcommandok 817B#49alice→followresumeok 1019B#50alice→writerlogok 248B#51alice→followresumeok 1551B#52alice→followresumeok 675B#53bob→writersubmitdeclined 486B#54bob→followresumeok 759B#55alice→followcommandok 85B#56alice→followresumeok 287B#57alice→writerlogok 248B#58alice→followresumeok 415B#59alice→followcommandok 80B#60alice→followresumeok 282B#61ali