{"name":"hosted-initial","text":"◆\nWorld\na\nalice\nb\nbob\n≡\nFrames\n?\nStart here\n▶\nDemos\nHosted World\n_\n×\nrelay\twss://nano.demo.dregg.online/ws\norigin\t300868a61428ae94e8f407f99b519f716841afaea20921c9ec1ffcd54da15786\nsponsor\te3c57f4ff4fac8bc15f9be86c2082593be4c70dbb8546900c9cbe1c0ae0d56c9 (guest-book)\nyou\tmember fa9cc452afed1a79cdce0cbeacfc038d53668ce821c2da237c135acbca3a63e1 grant 7aac4f9b540aa0e2d61983b5654d1de09dafb6031d5c846c1aca255f6f363b5e\n\nThe writer is a host serve process on another machine. This tab holds your keys and your follow. The follow checks each step before your key signs. A second tab of this page is a second member.\n\nTerms\nRelay\nThe relay \nis honest\nalters an event in the log\ndrops the last event of each log page\nloses the reply, then reports the call refused\nreports a cancel it never received\nserves a cancel alice did not sign\ndrops the call (a loss, not a lie)\n reset follow (cold)\nThe relay forwards every frame unchanged. Your follow checks every reply in any case.\nExample: choose \"alters an event in the log\", press reset follow, run nd sync. The writer logged the true Turn. Your follow checks the altered copy and refuses it (eventMismatch).\nFork check\n Check attestation\nTwo writers can serve the same genesis. A follow checks only its own writer. A signed head (attestation) from the other writer shows a fork: refused forkedWorld.\nLocal World\nFrames\n_\n×\nframe\t#6 (command 2)\nfrom → to\tyou → follow\nop\tresume\nbytes\t2362\nreply\tok\n#0\nyou\n→follow\ncommand\nok 80B\n#1\nyou\n→follow\nresume\nok 234B\n#2\nyou\n→follow\nresume\nok 378B\n#3\nyou\n→follow\ncommand\nok 12B\n#4\nyou\n→follow\nresume\nok 214B\n#5\nyou\n→host\nlog\nok 248B\n#6\nyou\n→follow\nresume\nok 2362B\nTerms\nyou\n_\n×\nYou are you, founder 0, member undefined. Your keys stay in this tab. Your follow (your copy of the World) checks each command before your key signs it.\nCommands: create · write OBJ SLOT TEXT · read OBJ [?] · grant OBJ MEMBER RIGHTS · invoke OBJ N ARGS · install TEXT · sync\n\nJoined by invitation. World origin 300868a6…. The invitation was checked against the sponsor key in world.json. Asking the guest-book (the member that enrols new members) to enrol you.\nyou$ nd init e3c57f4ff4fac8bc15f9be86c2082593be4c7…   (join token, signed by your new key)\njoin 20000000f47bfb2a0b4ba21ee9b15f37d0ef28f4e625d5b1750be30f069c17c5ff096f4c20000000411e20beb3873dfc83cf38398fb30bb4a770c2381aa870c01b7aff3b96eee353400000002a23675c54f41b36312366381f95d084ac21ab6555def8627323512f6403147e54b5287c1827fd1c9d00d9df1ca1d54b5d983cd8565112625ff8d011e6a0580a\n\nexit ok · 14.1 ms · 3 frames · ticks 0 / 2,097,152 this window\nEnrolled. member fa9cc452…, grant 7aac4f9b…. The writer runs elsewhere. Your follow checks each of its replies.\nyou$ nd sync\nheight 4\nchain d8180ef5…\nroots 40ea2695…\n\nexit ok · 576.1 ms · 4 frames · ticks 0 / 2,097,152 this window\nyou$ nd\n◆ nanodregg\nHosted World\nFrames\nyou\nwriter: honest · 7 frames · 2 commands"}
