[{"name":"flipEvent","text":"\nLie caught\n×\n×\nrefused eventMismatch\nlie\tby the writer: alters an event in the log\nresult\trefused by the member's follow: what the writer served does not match what the writer says. Nothing signed depends on it.\nlying frame\t#24 bob → writer log (rewritten by the relay)\nrow expects\trefused eventMismatch (row audit, line 13)\nmatch\tyes\n\neventMismatch: an event on the log page does not match the Turn the writer admitted; one byte differs from what was signed. The follow refuses the page and keeps nothing from it.\n\nOK\n◆ nanodregg\nWorld\nFrames\nalice\nbob\nTour\nwriter: LYING (flipEvent) · 26 frames · 3 commands"},{"name":"dropLastEvent","text":"\nLie caught\n×\n×\nrefused chainMismatch\nlie\tby the writer: drops the last event of each log page\nresult\trefused by the member's follow: what the writer served does not match what the writer says. Nothing signed depends on it.\nlying frame\t#24 bob → writer log (rewritten by the relay)\nrow expects\trefused chainMismatch (row audit, line 14)\nmatch\tyes\n\nchainMismatch: replaying the page does not produce the chain hash the writer reports. An event is missing, or the writer logged something other than what it served.\n\nOK\n◆ nanodregg\nWorld\nFrames\nalice\nbob\nTour\nwriter: LYING (dropLastEvent) · 26 frames · 3 commands"},{"name":"forgesRefusal","text":"\nLie caught\n×\n×\nrefused chainMismatch\nlie\tby the writer: logs a refusal under a different name\nresult\trefused by the member's follow: what the writer served does not match what the writer says. Nothing signed depends on it.\nlying frame\t#51 alice → writer log (from the lying writer)\nrow expects\trefused chainMismatch (row forgedRefusal, line 15)\nmatch\tyes\n\nchainMismatch: replaying the page does not produce the chain hash the writer reports. An event is missing, or the writer logged something other than what it served.\n\nOK\n◆ nanodregg\nWorld\nFrames\nalice\nbob\nTour\nwriter: LYING (forgesRefusal) · 53 frames · 7 commands"},{"name":"lieLookup","text":"s"},{"name":"lieCancel","text":"\nLie caught\n×\n×\nhostContradicted cancelled open\nlie\tby the writer: reports a cancel it never received\nresult\trefused by the member's follow: what the writer served does not match what the writer says. Nothing signed depends on it.\nlying frame\t#70 alice → writer cancel (rewritten by the relay)\nrow expects\thostContradicted cancelled open (row cancelLie, line 7)\nmatch\tyes\n\nhostContradicted: the writer reports one outcome for your call and your follow finds another. The attempt stays open. The writer's reply is shown and not acted on.\n\nOK\n◆ nanodregg\nWorld\nFrames\nalice\nbob\nTour\nwriter: LYING (lieCancel) · 75 frames · 3 commands"},{"name":"forgeCancel","text":"\nLie caught\n×\n×\nrefused cancelForged\nlie\tby the writer: serves a cancel alice did not sign\nresult\trefused by the member's follow: what the writer served does not match what the writer says. Nothing signed depends on it.\nlying frame\t#77 bob → writer log (rewritten by the relay)\nrow expects\trefused cancelForged (row cancelForged, line 8)\nmatch\tyes\n\ncancelForged: the page has a cancel whose signature is not its member's.\n\nOK\n◆ nanodregg\nWorld\nFrames\nalice\nbob\nTour\nwriter: LYING (forgeCancel) · 79 frames · 4 commands"},{"name":"forkedPost","text":"\nLie caught\n×\n×\nrefused forkedPost\nlie\tby a member: alice posts a false head for step 2\nwriter\thonest; it admitted the call (laws judge the new state, not the history)\nresult\trefused by the member's follow: what the writer served does not match the post. Nothing signed depends on it.\nlying frame\t#48 alice → writer submit (hostile call, admitted)\nrow expects\trefused forkedPost (row selfHead, line 12)\nmatch\tyes\n\nforkedPost: a member posted a head for a step of this World whose chain hash differs from your follow's at that step. Two histories claim one World. The page is kept; the post is refused.\n\nOK\n◆ nanodregg\nWorld\nFrames\nalice\nbob\nTour\nwriter: honest · 53 frames · 7 commands"}]
